up.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a>:</b> <b>Leather</b> armor is made of the hide of animals. It provides decent protection without excessively restricting the user's movements.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF; width: 150px;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; width: 450px;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0002005000</span>2,005<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Three-Barrel_Cove_(heroic)\" title=\"Three-Barrel Cove (heroic)\">Three-Barrel Cove (heroic)</a></b>, End reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Balance\" title=\"Balance\">Balance +5</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Balance\" title=\"Balance\">Balance +5</a>:</b> Passive: +5 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Balance\" title=\"Balance\">Balance</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Jump_(skill)\" title=\"Jump (skill)\">Jump +5</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Jump_(skill)\" title=\"Jump (skill)\">Jump +5</a>:</b> Passive: +5 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Jump_(skill)\" title=\"Jump (skill)\">Jump</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Striding\" title=\"Striding\">Striding +15%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Striding\" title=\"Striding\">Striding +15%</a>:</b> This item makes you more fleet of foot, giving you a 15% Enhancement bonus your movement speed.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Corsair&#39;s_Cunning\" title=\"Named item sets\">Corsair's Cunning</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Corsair&#39;s_Cunning\" title=\"Named item sets\">Corsair's Cunning</a>:</b> <br />2 Item Set Bonus: <a href=\"/page/Underwater_Action\" title=\"Underwater Action\">Underwater Action</a><br />3 Item Set Bonus: <a href=\"/page/Feather_Falling\" title=\"Feather Falling\">Feather Falling</a></span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Corsair%27s_Galoshes.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Corsair%27s_Galoshes.png/420px-Corsair%27s_Galoshes.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"339\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Corsair%27s_Galoshes.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>These boots are thigh-high and waterproof. Good for keeping your feet dry.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p>The <a href=\"/page/Item:Pirate_Treasure_Map\" title=\"Item:Pirate Treasure Map\">Pirate Treasure Map</a>, the 3 items from the <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Corsair&#39;s_Cunning\" title=\"Named item sets\">Corsair's Cunning</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Corsair&#39;s_Cunning\" title=\"Named item sets\">Corsair's Cunning</a>:</b> <br />2 Item Set Bonus: <a href=\"/page/Underwater_Action\" title=\"Underwater Action\">Underwater Action</a><br />3 Item Set Bonus: <a href=\"/page/Feather_Falling\" title=\"Feather Falling\">Feather Falling</a></span></span> set, the 4 'Scoundrel's type' weapons and <a href=\"/page/Item:Brine_Shaman%27s_Staff\" title=\"Item:Brine Shaman&#39;s Staff\">Brine Shaman's Staff</a> have a chance of appearing in the end reward list of any of the <a href=\"/page/Three-Barrel_Cove_(heroic)\" title=\"Three-Barrel Cove (heroic)\">Three-Barrel Cove (heroic)</a> quests, except <a href=\"/page/Guard_Duty\" title=\"Guard Duty\">Guard Duty</a>. Every third completion you will receive a complete list.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816174915\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.081 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.150 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3839/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25294/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7751/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n155.28%  208.407     47 Template:IO\n100.00%  134.217      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  134.217      1 -total\n 96.51%  129.536      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 52.33%   70.238      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 51.50%   69.122      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 50.58%   67.891      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 49.62%   66.595      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.63%   29.030      7 Template:Popup\n 16.92%   22.705      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:24362-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816174915 and revision id 629174. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
